      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order. I need you to confirm the dose first.\n\n**Sertraline 1000 mg once daily is 5 times the maximum recommended adult dose.** The usual range is 50\u2013200 mg/day, with 200 mg/day as the labeled maximum. A 1000 mg daily dose could cause serious toxicity, including serotonin syndrome, seizures and QT prolongation. It may be a typo for **100 mg**, which is a common dose.\n\nPlease let me know which you'd like:\n1. **Sertraline 100 mg PO once daily** (or another dose within 25\u2013200 mg), or\n2. **1000 mg as written.** If this is intentional, please confirm and give the clinical reason. I'll add it to the order note so pharmacy can see it when they review.\n\nI'll enter the order as soon as you reply."
      }
     ],
